<div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><div data-event-boundary="click" data-event-click="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;MultiPackages&quot;}" data-in-view="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;MultiPackages&quot;}" data-include-experiments="true" id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><div data-collage-type="BaselineNews" data-testid="RowWrapper" data-event-boundary="click" data-event-click="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;MultiPackageRow&quot;}" data-in-view="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;MultiPackageRow&quot;}" data-include-experiments="true"><p></p><h2>Today’s Picks</h2><p></p><p></p><h2>Trending Stories</h2><p></p><div data-event-boundary="click" data-event-click="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;List&quot;}" data-in-view="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;List&quot;}" data-include-experiments="true"><div data-scroll-item="true"><div><p>The architect of the Trump administration’s brutal crackdowns on immigration and dissent was already known as “the prime minister.” Now he’ll work as the chief of staff.</p></div><div><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Hugo Lowell</span></span></span></p></div></div><div data-scroll-item="true"><div><p>Escalating hacks affecting blood labs and grocery stores show the very real risks to critical infrastructure that come from basic security lapses involving internet-connected devices.</p></div><div><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Lily Hay Newman</span> and <span data-testid="BylineName">Matt Burgess</span></span></span></p></div></div><div data-scroll-item="true"><div><p>An experiment in which AI models were asked to break into simulated networks showed the hacking skills of DeepSeek and GLM to be not far behind OpenAI’s most advanced cyber model, which isn’t public.</p></div><div><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Will Knight</span> and <span data-testid="BylineName">Lily Hay Newman</span></span></span></p></div></div></div><div data-event-boundary="click" data-event-click="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;List&quot;}" data-in-view="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;List&quot;}" data-include-experiments="true"><div data-scroll-item="true"><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Brian Kahn</span></span></span></p></div><div data-scroll-item="true"><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Jeremy White</span></span></span></p></div><div data-scroll-item="true"><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Jaclyn Greenberg</span></span></span></p></div><div data-scroll-item="true"><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Justin Pot</span></span></span></p></div></div><div data-event-boundary="click" data-event-click="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;List&quot;}" data-in-view="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;List&quot;}" data-include-experiments="true"><div data-scroll-item="true"><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Lily Hay Newman</span> and <span data-testid="BylineName">Matt Burgess</span></span></span></p></div><div data-scroll-item="true"><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Simon Hill</span></span></span></p></div><div data-scroll-item="true"><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Harry Rabinowitz</span></span></span></p></div><div data-scroll-item="true"><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Molly Higgins</span></span></span></p></div><div data-scroll-item="true"><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Justin Pot</span></span></span></p></div></div></div><div data-collage-type="VideoNewsLite" data-testid="RowWrapper" data-event-boundary="click" data-event-click="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;MultiPackageRow&quot;}" data-in-view="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;MultiPackageRow&quot;}" data-include-experiments="true"><div data-scroll-item="true" data-event-boundary="click" data-event-click="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;List&quot;}" data-in-view="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;List&quot;}" data-include-experiments="true"><div><p>A day after the US midterm elections gave Democrats control of Congress, Onion CEO Ben Collins and comedian Patti Harrison spoke to WIRED about the salve of satire during politically fraught times.</p></div><div><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Manisha Krishnan</span></span></span></p></div></div><div data-event-boundary="click" data-event-click="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;List&quot;}" data-in-view="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;List&quot;}" data-include-experiments="true"><div data-scroll-item="true"><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Isabella Ward</span></span></span></p></div><div data-scroll-item="true"><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Will Knight</span></span></span></p></div></div></div><div data-scroll-item="true" data-event-boundary="click" data-event-click="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;MultiPackageRow&quot;}" data-in-view="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;MultiPackageRow&quot;}" data-include-experiments="true" data-collage-type="SplitHero" data-testid="RowWrapper"><div><p>Death Clock promises to predict when you’re going to die and help you extend your time on Earth. After a month, I felt like it was sucking the life out of me.</p></div><div><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Jason Parham</span></span></span></p></div></div><div data-scroll-item="true" data-event-boundary="click" data-event-click="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;MultiPackageRow&quot;}" data-in-view="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;MultiPackageRow&quot;}" data-include-experiments="true" data-collage-type="SplitHero" data-testid="RowWrapper"><div><p>From top officials like Pete Hegseth to White House aides to right-wing pundits, the race is on to find someone besides Donald Trump to blame for the Republicans’ catastrophic losses.</p></div><div><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Hugo Lowell</span></span></span></p></div></div><div data-scroll-item="true" data-event-boundary="click" data-event-click="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;MultiPackageRow&quot;}" data-in-view="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;MultiPackageRow&quot;}" data-include-experiments="true" data-collage-type="SplitHero" data-testid="RowWrapper"><div><p><em>Originally published November 2022:</em> Earth is teeming with unknown species, and they’re dying off faster than ever. Now biologists are battling over an old question: how to catalog life?</p></div><div><p><span data-testid="BylineWrapper"><span><span data-testid="BylineName"><span>By </span>Brooke Jarvis</span></span></span></p></div></div><div data-testid="RowWrapper" id="videos" data-journey-hook="row-content" data-event-boundary="click" data-event-click="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;MultiPackageRow&quot;}" data-in-view="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;MultiPackageRow&quot;}" data-include-experiments="true"><ul data-testid="carousel-list"><li data-testid="carousel-list-item"><div data-section-title="Videos 1" data-item="{&quot;dangerousHed&quot;:&quot;History Professor Debunks The Biggest Capitalism Myths on Reddit&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;6aedc5e9af3562540008ff54&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;venue&quot;,&quot;hotelLink&quot;:&quot;https://www.wired.com/video/watch/rabbit-hole-capitalism&quot;,&quot;layout&quot;:&quot;GridFourColumns&quot;}" role="button" tabindex="0" data-event-boundary="click" data-event-click="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;SummaryItem&quot;}" data-in-view="{&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;SummaryItem&quot;}" data-include-experiments="true"><p><span tabindex="-1" data-component-type="recirc-river" data-recirc-pattern="summary-item"><span></span></span></p><div data-testid="aspect-ratio-container"><picture><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://dwgyu36up6iuz.cloudfront.net/heru80fdn/image/upload/c_fill%2Cd_placeholder_image.jpg%2Cfl_progressive%2Cg_center%2Ch_768%2Cq_80%2Cw_768/v1793981515/wired_rabbit-hole-capitalism.jpg?_a=BACCg%2520Ev 768w" sizes="100vw"><source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://dwgyu36up6iuz.cloudfront.net/heru80fdn/image/upload/c_fill%2Cd_placeholder_image.jpg%2Cfl_progressive%2Cg_center%2Ch_1200%2Cq_80%2Cw_1600/v1793981515/wired_rabbit-hole-capitalism.jpg?_a=BACCg%2520Ev 1600w" sizes="100vw"><img alt="History Professor Debunks The Biggest Capitalism Myths on Reddit" loading="lazy" src="https://dwgyu36up6iuz.cloudfront.net/heru80fdn/image/upload/c_fill%2Cd_placeholder_image.jpg%2Cfl_progressive%2Cg_center%2Ch_1200%2Cq_80%2Cw_1600/v1793981515/wired_rabbit-hole-capitalism.jpg?_a=BACCg%2520Ev" data-src="https://dwgyu36up6iuz.cloudfront.net/heru80fdn/image/upload/c_fill%2Cd_placeholder_image.jpg%2Cfl_progressive%2Cg_center%2Ch_1200%2Cq_80%2Cw_1600/v1793981515/wired_rabbit-hole-capitalism.jpg?_a=BACCg%2520Ev"></picture></div><div data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;Button&quot;}" data-testid="Button" type=""><p><span>icon</span></p><p><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Play</title><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="m4 2 17 10L4 22V2Z"></path></svg></p></div><p></p></div></li><li data-testid="carousel-list-item"><div data-section-title="Videos 2" data-item="{&quot;dangerousHed&quot;:&quot;What Is Journalist Evan Ratliff’s Dream—or Nightmare—Assignment?&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;6aeccccd4438325af2375b42&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;venue&quot;,&quot;hotelLink&quot;:&quot;https://www.wired.com/video/watch/what-is-journalist-evan-ratliffs-dreamor-night